s for his theater by hosting a singing competition.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446893,\"title\":\"Trolls World Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":901362,\"title\":\"Trolls Band Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkpPTZUdq31UGDovmszsg2CchiI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Branch's brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1584,\"title\":\"The School of Rock\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zXLXaepIBvFVLU25DH3wv4IPSbe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k5MTAtE9CCi5TWA84qaFMYv3ajB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fired from his band and hard up for cash, guitarist and vocalist Dewey Finn finagles his way into a job as a fifth-grade substitute teacher at a private school, where he secretly begins teaching his straight-A students the finer points of rock 'n' roll and the power of sticking it to the man. But as the school’s stern principal closes in and the Battle of the Bands looms, Dewey must risk everything to prove that rock 'n' roll can change lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":254470,\"title\":\"Pitch Perfect 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fQaEGzFmvTYu3G641WV0Tg9auAt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bWOfRV1Ubk9SWEDZDDjsmIUCcbZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Bellas are back, and they are better than ever. After being humiliated in front of none other than the President of the United States of America, the Bellas are taken out of the Aca-Circuit. In order to clear their name, and regain their status, the Bellas take on a seemingly impossible task: winning an international competition no American team has ever won. In order to accomplish this monumental task, they need to strengthen the bonds of friendship and sisterhood and blow away the competition with their amazing aca-magic! With all new friends and old rivals tagging along for the trip, the Bellas can hopefully accomplish their dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23398,\"title\":\"Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2tgUeWadVJs1g6zOCZgKRs8uWC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3lf6YCItKcF3Wrrs7tp1PL0eyOT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of Dave Seville's twenty-something nephew Toby. The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the school's music program by winning the $25,000 prize in a battle of the bands. But the Chipmunks unexpectedly meet their match in three singing chipmunks known as The Chipettes - Brittany, Eleanor and Jeanette. Romantic and musical sparks are ignited 